		<div id="post-5" class="">
			<div class="entry-head">
				<h3 class="entry-title"><a href="http://www.productdevelopmentco.com/2009/02/27/welcome/" rel="bookmark" title='Permanent Link to "Welcome"'>Welcome</a></h3>

				<div class="entry-meta">
					<span class="meta-start">Published</span>  <div class="entry-date"><span class="meta-prep">on</span> <abbr class="published" title="2009-02-27T00:40:33-0800">February 27, 2009</abbr></div> <div class="entry-categories"><span class="meta-prep">in</span> <a href="http://www.productdevelopmentco.com/category/uncategorized/" title="View all posts in Uncategorized">Uncategorized</a></div><span class="meta-end">.</span>
					<a href="http://www.productdevelopmentco.com/2009/02/27/welcome/#respond" class="commentslink"  title="Comment on Welcome">0&nbsp;<span>Comments</span></a>
					
									</div> <!-- .entry-meta -->
			</div> <!-- .entry-head -->

			<div class="entry-content">
				<p>Welcome to our website! We are looking forward to working with you!</p>
<p>Product Development Co. is a new product development company that turns <em>great</em> <strong>ideas</strong> into <em>great</em> <strong>products</strong>.</p>
<p>Our mission is to help each of our client&#8217;s prepare their product to reach the potential for optimal sales in the market.</p>
<p>We help design, engineer, and create a viable product to be well-received by it&#8217;s end user.</p>
<p>Our staff has worked with a variety of companies, ranging from start-ups to Fortune 5000 companies, in the design, engineering, and prototyping of new products.</p>
<p>We are committed to delivering value-based services to you, with less hassle.</p>
<p>To learn more about how we can help you create a better product, while saving time and money, call us at the number above for a free consultation.</p>

							</div> <!-- .entry-content -->

		</div> <!-- #post-ID -->

		

 

</div><!-- #rollingcontent .hfeed -->

